            "review_title": "Review at Mạ Quán",
            "review_text": "Stonki\nHamburg, Germany378 contributions\n0\nBig disappointment\nApr 2024 • Business\nLet's start with the positive: The location is in a back courtyard on the first floor, everything is very \"quaint\", a bit run down. You then come into the restaurant and you enter a new world. That's something. \n\nThe menu has lots of pictures, so you can make a good decision visually. That's certainly one of the reasons why many Europeans were there. \n\nWhat unfortunately can't keep up is the food. It was all mediocre. Not good quality, very mediocrely prepared. The meat was tough, the fish was poor. Nothing really bad, but poor.\n\nThere were 5 of us at a business meeting, 1 Vietnamese and 2 Chinese. The \"Ma Quan\" was my request because the hotel had highly recommended it to me and everyone was disappointed. We then had another meal in another restaurant that I had been to the day before (see other review) to end the evening nicely. \n\nWhat a shame.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nShow original\nWritten May 18, 2024",
            "rating": 5.0,
            "review_date": "2026-10-14",
            "travel_date": "Recent",
            "feature_depth_status": "Schema-Full-Features-Validated"
        },
