            "review_text": "MKSG\nSingapore, Singapore52 contributions\n0\nWonderful restaurant\nFeb 2024 • Family\nHad dinner the other night at Ma Quant. The foods were great. Not exactly the typically Vietnamese cuisine but they were delicious and well presented. The restaurant is a bit hard to find. It's located on the second floor of the building. There is no clear signage. You have to walk to the art galleries alley then turn first right to find the staircase located at the end.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten March 3, 2024",
            "rating": 5.0,
